{40}{The Inner Circle protects the last vestiges of magic in Latveria.  Since Doom has been on his murderous campaign, no mages have been safe.  Therefore we've made a base in the old forest to the southwest of town, past the river.}{The Inner Circle protects the last vestiges of magic in Latveria.  Since Doom has been on his murderous campaign, no mages have been safe.  Therefore we've made a base in the old forest to the southwest of town, past the river.}{}{}{}{}
